 },
 "stopOnFailure": false,
 "checklist": "M1 (v5): a whole card (LUMINA_CARD_DIR, only read). Cull scrolls down and back within the frame budget (p95 ≤ 17.5 ms), 150 fast row moves leave the cursor on a photo, a 3,000-input storm holds every invariant, ⌘3 and ⌘2 still switch steps, and the web process stays under 2.5 GB. `probe.sh stress` runs it twice: the page's own read, then the app's native read.",
 "steps": [
